Interop tests (nested module interop/, not part of the library)
---------------------------------------------------------------

The tests install pysunspec2 1.3.6 from PyPI (Apache License 2.0, by the
SunSpec Alliance) into a python:3.12.10-slim container while they run.
Neither pysunspec2 nor the image is redistributed, and no pysunspec2 code
is in this repository; testdata/pysunspec2_device.py is our own script
that calls it.

Test data
---------

The inverter image in sunspec_test.go uses a real manufacturer's name and
model name as text only, with made-up serial and register values; every
other identity, address and value in the tests and examples is made up.
